<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><gpx version="1.1" creator="The Gunks Gravel Escape" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>Sky Lakes loop · overnight in New Paltz · Sky Lakes · two loops from town</name><desc>Start and finish at the Wallkill Valley Rail Trail crossing at Main Street, beside Water Street Market. Lodging is a short walk from the finish. Pack lunch and water in town before leaving.</desc><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>OpenStreetMap linework</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bike-Map-2024.pdf"><text>Designated ridge bicycle routes</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/where/new-york/shawangunks/river-to-ridge-trail"><text>River-to-Ridge map</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/recreation-activities/mountain-biking/"><text>Mountain House carriage roads</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/news/lake-awosting-restoration"><text>Lake Awosting loop reopening</text></link><link href="https://parks.ny.gov/visit/state-parks/minnewaska-state-park-preserve"><text>Minnewaska map and cycling conditions</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonkpreserve.org/plan-your-visit/"><text>Cycling day pass and hours</text></link><link href="https://forecast.weather.gov/MapClick.php?lat=41.736&amp;lon=-74.197"><text>Current point forecast</text></link><link href="https://511ny.org/"><text>Road incidents and traffic</text></link><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>How the ride was measured</text></link><link href="https://data.usgs.gov/datacatalog/data/USGS%3A3a81321b-c153-416f-98b7-cc8e5f0e17c3"><text>Elevation estimates</text></link></metadata><wpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"><name>1. New Paltz · Water Street Market start</name><desc>Start on the north side of Main Street at the rail-trail crossing. Walk west on the sidewalk toward the Wallkill River.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746712" lon="-74.089882"><name>2. Water Street crosswalk</name><desc>Walk across Water Street in the crosswalk. Follow the north sidewalk onto the separated bridge path.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"><name>3. Carmine Liberta Bridge · west bank</name><desc>At the west end of the bridge, turn north onto the River-to-Ridge path beside the Wallkill River.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.750376" lon="-74.095296"><name>4. Springtown Road · outbound crossing</name><desc>Cross the road at the trailhead and continue west into the fields.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.748664" lon="-74.109195"><name>5. River-to-Ridge field fork</name><desc>Follow the northern branch of the field loop toward Butterville Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.752119" lon="-74.123434"><name>6. Butterville Road · outbound crossing</name><desc>Yield at the marked crossing and continue toward Pine Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751247" lon="-74.124877"><name>7. Pine Road · outbound crossing</name><desc>Cross Pine Road and follow the signed River-to-Ridge route to the Foothills. Follow any posted construction controls.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>8. Foothills · east to the Gateway</name><desc>Turn east onto Lenape Lane toward the stone Testimonial Gateway. The route returns to this junction after the pass stop.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.744979" lon="-74.118505"><name>9. Testimonial Gateway · cycling pass</name><desc>The bike track turns at the arch. Walk the signed footpath to the trailhead booth for today&#39;s cycling pass and the Mountain House waiver. Return west on the Pin Oak Allée.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>10. Foothills · uphill on Lenape</name><desc>Continue west on Lenape Lane and climb to the Lower Duck Pond Road junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.754881" lon="-74.138625"><name>11. Lower Duck Pond Road</name><desc>Leave Lenape Lane and take Lower Duck Pond Road toward the pond. Follow the bicycle carriage road along the water.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.753538" lon="-74.145161"><name>12. Duck Pond · Glory Hill Road</name><desc>From the northwest side of the pond, take Glory Hill Road toward Oakwood Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751899" lon="-74.150745"><name>13. Oakwood Drive · climb to the bridge</name><desc>Leave Glory Hill Road for Oakwood Drive. Follow it west to Rhododendron Bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.758328" lon="-74.165507"><name>14. Rhododendron Bridge · Overcliff outbound</name><desc>Cross the small bridge and take Overcliff Carriage Road southwest toward Trapps Bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.737013" lon="-74.194011"><name>15. Trapps Bridge · cross above US 44/NY 55</name><desc>Cross the pedestrian and bicycle bridge. Follow Trapps Road west to Lyons Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.73513" lon="-74.218834"><name>16. Lyons Road · cross to Minnewaska</name><desc>Cross the paved public road and continue onto Awosting Falls Carriage Road. The return crosses here again.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.734277" lon="-74.237454"><name>17. Awosting Falls</name><desc>Stop at the signed falls viewpoint. Continue on the carriage road to the paved park entrance drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.734173" lon="-74.23863"><name>18. Long route · Lower Awosting</name><desc>Walk north across the short park-drive bridge and take the Awosting Falls Connection west. For the shorter Lake Minnewaska loop, cross the drive and climb Scenic Sunset instead.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.734673" lon="-74.243793"><name>19. Lower Awosting trailhead</name><desc>Walk through the short trailhead access and join Lower Awosting Carriage Road. Follow the black blazes toward Lake Awosting.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.711881" lon="-74.283547"><name>20. Lake Awosting · west shore</name><desc>Take the black-blazed Lake Awosting Carriage Road around the western shore. Stay beside the lake where the Castle Point road branches away.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.711237" lon="-74.281059"><name>21. Upper Awosting · east to Lake Minnewaska</name><desc>Leave the lakeshore on Upper Awosting Carriage Road. Follow the green blazes toward Lake Minnewaska.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.727451" lon="-74.238259"><name>22. Lake Minnewaska · west shore</name><desc>Join the red lakeside carriage road. Look for the departure of the blue Castle Point road on the right.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.725422" lon="-74.237643"><name>23. Castle Point Carriage Road</name><desc>Turn onto the blue-blazed Castle Point Carriage Road and follow it up the ridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.702759" lon="-74.273632"><name>24. Castle Point overlook</name><desc>Pause at the viewpoint, then continue on the blue carriage road to Hamilton Point Carriage Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.703251" lon="-74.274792"><name>25. Hamilton Point Carriage Road</name><desc>Turn onto the yellow-blazed carriage road for the return above the Palmaghatt Ravine.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.719863" lon="-74.238112"><name>26. Millbrook Mountain junction</name><desc>Take Millbrook Mountain Carriage Road north toward the Lake Minnewaska shore.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.721679" lon="-74.234603"><name>27. Lake Minnewaska · eastern shore</name><desc>Follow the red lake carriage road north along the east shore toward the visitor center.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.729441" lon="-74.235017"><name>28. Visitor-center junction</name><desc>Stay on the short bicycle carriage-road link toward Scenic Sunset.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.728068" lon="-74.237296"><name>29. Scenic Sunset · descent</name><desc>Leave the lake and descend the orange Scenic Sunset Carriage Road to the park entrance drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.734133" lon="-74.238627"><name>30. Park entrance drive · return crossing</name><desc>Walk across the drive and rejoin Awosting Falls Carriage Road eastbound. Pass the falls on the way back to Lyons Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.73513" lon="-74.218834"><name>31. Lyons Road · cross back to Mohonk</name><desc>Cross Lyons Road onto the gravel Trapps carriage road. Follow it east to Trapps Bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.737013" lon="-74.194011"><name>32. Trapps Bridge · Undercliff return</name><desc>After crossing the bridge over US 44/NY 55, take Undercliff Carriage Road beneath the climbing cliffs.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.758328" lon="-74.165507"><name>33. Rhododendron Bridge · return</name><desc>At the end of Undercliff cross Rhododendron Bridge and descend on Oakwood Drive. Stay on Oakwood at the Glory Hill junction to reach Lenape Lane.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.764665" lon="-74.140982"><name>34. Lenape Lane · descend to the fields</name><desc>Turn south and downhill on Lenape Lane to the Foothills junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>35. Foothills · River-to-Ridge return</name><desc>Leave Lenape Lane and take River-to-Ridge northeast across the fields toward New Paltz.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751247" lon="-74.124877"><name>36. Pine Road · return crossing</name><desc>Cross Pine Road toward the farm fields and Butterville Road. Follow posted construction controls.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.752119" lon="-74.123434"><name>37. Butterville Road · return crossing</name><desc>Cross the paved road on the field trail toward the Wallkill River.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751616" lon="-74.118573"><name>38. Southern field branch</name><desc>Take the southern branch of the field loop heading east. The branches meet again before Springtown Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.750376" lon="-74.095296"><name>39. Springtown Road · return crossing</name><desc>Cross toward the river and follow the riverside path south to the bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"><name>40. Carmine Liberta Bridge · eastbound</name><desc>Use the separated bridge path into town. Walk the short sidewalk and use the Water Street crosswalk.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"><name>41. New Paltz · Water Street Market finish</name><desc>Finish on the north sidewalk at Main Street and the Wallkill Valley Rail Trail, at the same point where you started.</desc></wpt><trk><name>Sky Lakes loop · overnight in New Paltz · Sky Lakes · two loops from town</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"/><trkpt lat="41.746828" lon="-74.08925"/><trkpt lat="41.74671" lon="-74.089777"/><trkpt lat="41.746701" lon="-74.089844"/><trkpt lat="41.746712" lon="-74.089882"/><trkpt lat="41.746716" lon="-74.089991"/><trkpt lat="41.746718" lon="-74.090071"/><trkpt lat="41.746721" lon="-74.090085"/><trkpt lat="41.746744" lon="-74.090217"/><trkpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"/><trkpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.090895"/><trkpt lat="41.746864" lon="-74.090922"/><trkpt lat="41.746887" lon="-74.090954"/><trkpt lat="41.746904" lon="-74.090987"/><trkpt lat="41.746922" lon="-74.091036"/><trkpt lat="41.746961" lon="-74.091164"/><trkpt lat="41.746986" lon="-74.091234"/><trkpt lat="41.747025" lon="-74.091338"/><trkpt lat="41.747113" lon="-74.091546"/><trkpt lat="41.747177" lon="-74.091711"/><trkpt lat="41.747217" lon="-74.091796"/><trkpt lat="41.747276" lon="-74.091867"/><trkpt lat="41.747336" lon="-74.091901"/><trkpt lat="41.747384" lon="-74.091897"/><trkpt lat="41.747419" lon="-74.091876"/><trkpt lat="41.747451" lon="-74.091842"/><trkpt lat="41.747476" lon="-74.091798"/><trkpt lat="41.747512" lon="-74.091685"/><trkpt lat="41.74753" lon="-74.091554"/><trkpt lat="41.747535" lon="-74.09147"/><trkpt lat="41.747537" lon="-74.091318"/><trkpt lat="41.747549" lon="-74.091211"/><trkpt lat="41.747582" lon="-74.091115"/><trkpt lat="41.747661" lon="-74.091015"/><trkpt lat="41.747718" lon="-74.090967"/><trkpt lat="41.74777" lon="-74.09095"/><trkpt lat="41.74782" lon="-74.090932"/><trkpt lat="41.747961" lon="-74.090887"/><trkpt lat="41.748184" lon="-74.090831"/><trkpt lat="41.748349" lon="-74.090797"/><trkpt lat="41.748545" lon="-74.090775"/><trkpt lat="41.748794" lon="-74.090756"/><trkpt lat="41.74891" lon="-74.09075"/><trkpt lat="41.749156" lon="-74.090745"/><trkpt lat="41.749335" lon="-74.090751"/><trkpt lat="41.749461" lon="-74.090768"/><trkpt lat="41.749643" lon="-74.090798"/><trkpt lat="41.750003" lon="-74.09086"/><trkpt lat="41.750249" lon="-74.090947"/><trkpt lat="41.750331" lon="-74.09098"/><trkpt lat="41.750402" lon="-74.091012"/><trkpt lat="41.750541" lon="-74.091071"/><trkpt lat="41.750765" lon="-74.091195"/><trkpt lat="41.750823" lon="-74.091237"/><trkpt lat="41.750925" lon="-74.091318"/><trkpt lat="41.750999" lon="-74.091387"/><trkpt lat="41.75106" lon="-74.091471"/><trkpt lat="41.751112" lon="-74.091596"/><trkpt lat="41.751126" lon="-74.091701"/><trkpt lat="41.751131" lon="-74.091817"/><trkpt lat="41.751129" lon="-74.091874"/><trkpt lat="41.75113" lon="-74.091969"/><trkpt lat="41.751144" lon="-74.092134"/><trkpt lat="41.75116" lon="-74.092195"/><trkpt lat="41.751191" lon="-74.092237"/><trkpt lat="41.751228" lon="-74.092268"/><trkpt lat="41.751274" lon="-74.09229"/><trkpt lat="41.751339" lon="-74.09228"/><trkpt lat="41.751427" lon="-74.092266"/><trkpt lat="41.751514" lon="-74.092254"/><trkpt lat="41.751616" lon="-74.092246"/><trkpt lat="41.751654" lon="-74.09225"/><trkpt lat="41.751684" lon="-74.092254"/><trkpt lat="41.751731" lon="-74.092282"/><trkpt lat="41.751782" lon="-74.09233"/><trkpt lat="41.751833" lon="-74.092428"/><trkpt lat="41.751871" lon="-74.092508"/><trkpt lat="41.751899" lon="-74.092569"/><trkpt lat="41.75195" lon="-74.09271"/><trkpt lat="41.751992" lon="-74.092825"/><trkpt lat="41.752081" lon="-74.093074"/><trkpt lat="41.752104" lon="-74.09314"/><trkpt lat="41.752122" lon="-74.093195"/><trkpt lat="41.752215" lon="-74.093458"/><trkpt lat="41.752274" lon="-74.093633"/><trkpt lat="41.752317" lon="-74.093747"/><trkpt lat="41.752391" lon="-74.093922"/><trkpt lat="41.752518" lon="-74.094176"/><trkpt lat="41.752634" lon="-74.094435"/><trkpt lat="41.752667" lon="-74.094556"/><trkpt lat="41.752656" lon="-74.094655"/><trkpt lat="41.752634" lon="-74.094709"/><trkpt lat="41.752588" lon="-74.094777"/><trkpt lat="41.752525" lon="-74.094825"/><trkpt lat="41.752464" lon="-74.094857"/><trkpt lat="41.75